cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Traffic Survey Application Suite"
abstract: >-
  A modular, offline-first progressive web application suite for
  multi-module traffic field data collection, built around a shared
  data-capture engine that queues events locally and synchronizes them
  to a Google Apps Script backend in batches, keeping a multi-hour field
  session within a free-tier execution quota that per-event requests
  alone would exceed.
